      "side": 1,
      "message": "The file will become 0-length, so if they\u0027re reading the file, it\u0027ll get truncated. There\u0027s a potential crash if they have the file mmapped and they read from memory.\n\nHowever, this only gets called via the app getting uninstalled or `am clear-exit-info`, so it shouldn\u0027t actually happen?",
